OL,3,AWhy Australia chose the world's biggest
OL,4,Apolitical stage to reveal OpenAI hack
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralia made a dramatic revelation on
OL,7,FWednesday during the United Nations
OL,8,FGeneral Assembly.
OL,10,FRogue AI agents had hacked one of its
OL,11,Fgovernment bodies - the first known
OL,12,Fincident of its kind in the world.
OL,13,FPrivate data, but not sensitive
OL,14,Finformation, was taken from Medicare,
OL,15,FAustralia's universal healthcare
OL,16,Fscheme.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
