OL,3,AGreek PM urges Burnham to return Elgin
OL,4,AMarbles permanently
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Greek prime minister has called on
OL,7,FAndy Burnham to find the "political
OL,8,Fwill" to send the Parthenon sculptures
OL,9,Fback to Greece.
OL,11,FKyriakos Mitsotakis wrote in the
OL,12,FGuardian that returning the classical
OL,13,Ftreasures, also known as the Elgin
OL,14,FMarbles in the UK, would "send a
OL,15,Fpowerful signal" but would require
OL,16,F"courage".
OL,18,FThe sculptures have been on display in
OL,19,Fthe British Museum since the 19th
OL,20,FCentury, though Greece has long
OL,21,Fdisputed the legality of their removal.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1790279644
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGreek PM urges Burnham to return Elgin
OL,4,AMarbles permanently
OL,5,
OL,6,FMitsotakis and his government have
OL,7,Fpreviously held talks with the British
OL,8,FMuseum about the sculptures, but the
OL,9,Ftwo have so far failed to reach an
OL,10,Fagreement, with Greek authorities
OL,11,Fseeking their permanent return.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
